<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-BHP sees steady results improvement.</title>
<headline>RTRS-BHP sees steady results improvement.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Minerals, petroleum and steel giant The Broken Hill Pty Co Ltd said on Tuesday it expects a steady improvement in results in its second and third quarters.</p>
</text>
